WEBVTT

00:02:29.003 --> 00:02:31.741
"Sophie, come speak to daddy."

00:02:32.889 --> 00:02:35.809
Dad sounds different, far away.

00:02:36.571 --> 00:02:38.421
He says he can't talk for very long,

00:02:38.445 --> 00:02:41.452
and anyway, it's very noisy
wherever he is.

00:02:41.476 --> 00:02:44.580
And Sophie doesn't know
what to say to him.

00:02:46.631 --> 00:02:49.392
Well, as stories go,
that's not a very nice one.

00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:54.069
In the United Kingdom, 200,000 children

00:02:54.093 --> 00:02:58.248
experience the shame and isolation
of a parent in prison.

00:02:59.117 --> 00:03:01.172
Two hundred thousand.